This license covers the Studio Yebisu example only: index.html, styles.css,
app.js, request.txt, samples.json, measurements.json, README.md, video/,
cad/ (plan.md, build.json, resize.json, walk.json, expected.json,
check_design.py), and the CAD outputs made from them with SolidCraft:
outputs/ (tray-default.json, tray-resized.json, .step, .stl) and renders/
(the four PNG model renders). The request, the workshop and its use are
fictional.

vendor/solidcraft/ is an unmodified copy of files from SolidCraft
(bherbruck/solidcraft, commit 16c49c3e860a954e9f27309927d6848bcba9c607).
Upstream is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; this example redistributes those
files under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See
vendor/solidcraft/LICENSE-APACHE and vendor/solidcraft/NOTICE
(Copyright (c) 2026 SolidCraft contributors). The SolidCraft program itself
is not included; the outputs were made with the official 0.11.1 release
(commit b01b9689c8999a4415b4a6daaa2f8aae8a1a2f25), which is pinned
separately from the reference commit above.
